  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a medium saucepan with water. Add brown rice and a generous pinch of salt.\n• Bring to a boil over high heat and cook, uncovered, until tender, 25-30 minutes. Drain and return to saucepan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-bd208400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Cut Malaysian tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-0ffedb10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-2c314b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! This is a mild paste, but use less if you're sensitive to heat! Reduce heat to medium-high. Add mild Thai red curry paste and garlic paste, cook, stirring, until coated and fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add coconut milk, the soy sauce, brown sugar, Asian greens and a splash of water and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-49c0b130.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low and simmer until the tofu is cooked through and the veggies are tender, 3-4 minutes. Add a dash more water if the curry looks dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-dac41840.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide brown rice between bowls.\n• Top with mild Thai red tofu curry. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86c4e4264524ca979eb21/step-a6405850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
